<title>USA: Genta says Nasdaq listing will continue.</title>
<headline>Genta says Nasdaq listing will continue.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genta Inc Wednesday said it has met terms for the requirements for its continued stock listing on the Nasdaq stock exchange.</p>
<p>In a statement, Genta said its stock will resume trading under the symbol GNTA as of July 24.</p>
<p>Genta said it met the final requirement by strengthening its balance sheet with a minimum of $6 million in capital and surplus.</p>
